 "about": "What each Masters WAG skill is, for detecting the Composition Requirements (UCG Masters Rules Policy v2.1 §III.C.2-3; rules/UCG-MASTERS/digest/scoring.json). The CoP prints no CR marks (Nate 2026-10-20), so the planner keeps its own tags: WG skills by their WG group and name, the Masters-only skills by hand. Tags: UB mount, dismount, kip, bar_change, circle, turn180 (long-axis turn of 180° or more), turn180_opt (the box allows such a turn: assumed done), flight; BB mount, dismount, dance, leap (leap/jump/hop), split (leap or jump with split or straddle), turn (on one leg), acro, flight, hold; FX dance, leap, split, turn, acro, flight, fwd (forward or sideward), bwd. A skill with no entry (or typed in) meets nothing by itself: the coach ticks the CR. Built into js/data/masters-wag-tags.js by tools/build_data.py.",
